[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C08_EASTERN_EQUESTRIA_PROBLEM]
Eastern Equestria Problem

[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C08_EASTERN_EQUESTRIA_PROBLEM_desc]
Eastern Equestria is now finally stable, but that’s the unstable sort of stability. Stable, but not completely stable.

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_C08_EASTERN_EQUESTRIA_PROBLEM]
